---
import Layout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About"
	description="From game servers and reverse engineering to APIs, automation, and AI agents — the path to full-stack development."
	eyebrow="cat ~/trajectory.md"
>
	<p>
		My path in technology started independently, driven by curiosity to understand, modify, and create systems. Before 42 Rio, I was already building personal projects, automations, and tools for game environments, where I learned logic, system architecture, and problem-solving in practice.
	</p>

	<p>
		During that period, I worked with Rust game servers, handling configuration, maintenance, and custom plugin development. That experience brought me close to back-end development, real-time events, business rules, online communities, and platform customization.
	</p>

	<p>
		I also explored automations and tools for popular games, which strengthened my interest in reverse engineering, software analysis, scripting, and building solutions that interact with existing systems. That experimental foundation was key to developing autonomy, technical reasoning, and the ability to learn new technologies quickly.
	</p>

	<p>
		Today, I continue expanding that trajectory as a full-stack developer with experience in C, Python, and JavaScript, working on web applications, APIs, integrations, databases, automations, and AI agents. My focus is building functional, scalable, well-structured systems that connect technical knowledge with practical solutions.
	</p>

	<div class="modules">
		<span class="mono-label">modules loaded</span>
		<ul>
			<li>C</li>
			<li>Python</li>
			<li>JavaScript</li>
			<li>APIs & integrations</li>
			<li>Databases</li>
			<li>Automations</li>
			<li>AI agents</li>
			<li>Game servers</li>
			<li>Reverse engineering</li>
		</ul>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	.modules {
		margin-top: 2.5rem;
		padding-top: 1.75rem;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
	}
	.modules .mono-label {
		display: block;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}
	.modules ul {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 0;
		list-style: none;
	}
	.modules li {
		padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem;
		border: 1px solid var(--oxide-line);
		border-radius: 999px;
		background: var(--oxide-soft);
		color: var(--oxide-2);
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.85rem;
	}
</style>